			"notes": "Advanced Ore Deposits 1.0.1\n\nChanges:\n- Added `onlyDropIfMinedByPlayer`, default true.\n- Automation now only consumes a deposit cycle when it can insert chunks into an inventory above or below the deposit while that option is enabled.\n- Prevents automation from spraying loose chunk items when no inventory is available.\n- Player mining and explosions still consume/drop normally.\n- Create goggles sync after player mining now repeats for a short window so the counter refreshes after client break prediction.\n- Added a detailed config button tooltip explaining the true/false behavior.\n- Restored Gradle wrapper and GitHub Actions files so the repo is clone-and-build ready.\n- Rewrote repo history to remove inherited NeoForge MDK contributors."
